    ("measurement framework for plan", "BrE /ˈmeʒəmənt ˈfreɪmwɜːk fə(r) plæn/", "AmE /ˈmɛʒɚmənt ˈfɹéɪˌmwɝk ˈfɔɹ ˈplæn/", "方案度量体系", "Measurement frameworks for a plan name the review that follows each number.", "方案度量体系会为每个数字指明随后的复盘。"),
