    ("brand risk assessment", "BrE /brænd rɪsk əˌsesmənt/", "AmE /ˈbɹænd ˈɹɪsk əˈsɛsmənt/", "品牌风险评估", "Brand risk assessments cover the risks nobody can attribute to marketing.", "品牌风险评估涵盖那些无法归因于营销的风险。"),
